    "Reason : 1 - The proposed lighting scheme is considered unacceptable with the proposed external doors and external gates not being provided with sufficient lighting coverage, furthermore inconstant proposed lux levels and non-uniform external lighting would lead to dark areas being created. The proposed lighting scheme would therefore fail to adequately mitigate anti-social behavioural impacts and risks of crime and disorder, contrary to Policy D11 C of the London Plan (2021) and Policy DM2 A (d) of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013)."
